{
  "translations": [
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-0-8ad88d30d16509e6",
      "translatedText": "Rust 程序……",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-1-6bb52a7f4cfb18ff",
      "translatedText": "编程",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-2-6681bf2d82976dac",
      "translatedText": "猜谜游戏",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-3-54fa9a3d1b5feb94",
      "translatedText": "让我们通过一个实践项目来一起深入学习 Rust！本章将通过一个真实程序展示如何使用 Rust，从而为您介绍几个常见的 Rust 概念。您将学习到 let、match、方法、关联函数、外部 crate 等内容！在接下来的章节中，我们将更详细地探讨这些概念。在本章中，您只需练习基础知识即可。",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-4-41fd2fe54d0d3179",
      "translatedText": "我们将实现一个经典的编程入门问题：猜谜游戏。它的工作原理如下：程序会生成一个 100 以内的随机整数。然后它会提示玩家输入一个猜测。输入猜测后，程序会指出猜测是太低还是太高。如果猜测正确，游戏将打印一条祝贺信息并退出。",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-5-900ded218d7ee904",
      "translatedText": "建立新项目",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    },
    {
      "groupId": "server-v4-6-c156d461822b6f12",
      "translatedText": "要建立一个新项目，请前往您在第几章中创建的项目目录并执行",
      "detectedSourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "zh"
    }
  ]
}

